"Publishes the seller details from the setup wizard (name, address, NIP, "
"REGON, e-mail, phone) as the [polski_business_info] shortcode and a "
"Gutenberg block, for the footer identification Polish consumer law expects. "
"Off by default: it prints your company data wherever you place it."
